  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to essential services and to exercise rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to essential services, including education, and to exercise rights. Inclusion of people with disabilities is a significant object of the project, An example is ensuring universal access to learning facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
